		{
			dependencies: ["2070C70B2AB53F23"]
			description: [
				"&eMythic Challenges are leveled endgame boss encounters where you have to defeat a boss under a certain time."
				""
				"&7Read the next pages to know about specifics on how Mythic Challenges work."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&lUpgrading your Hourglass"
				""
				"&7Each boss has a certain time limit to defeat it, which is divided into 3 parts."
				""
				"&7First part will be at roughly 17% of the total time, if you defeat the boss at that time, it will upgrade &e3 levels&7, then between 18% and 66%, it will upgrade &e2 levels&7 when defeated, and finally from 67% onwards it will upgrade only one level. If you run out of time, the &echallenge will be stopped&7 and you will lose, your hourglass will also be &edowngraded by one level&7."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lAffixes"
				""
				"&7They contain up to three random &eaffixes &7that modify how the fight works, from adding modifiers to spawning extra enemies or altering mechanics."
				""
				"&7First affix is unlocked on all challenges, and contains Tier I affixes."
				"&7Second affix is the Tier II, unlocked after +10."
				"&7Third affix is the Tier III, unlocked after  +16."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&lExpiry"
				""
				"&7Every hourglass resets on Fridays, so for example a +15 hourglass will turn back into +1 every friday."
				""
				"&7At the end of each hourglass you will see your currently weekly record."
				""
				"&7Upgrades are based on how"
			]
			id: "3030011D88FE9091"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "16288B501F79A4DB"
					type: "xp_levels"
					xp_levels: 5
				}
				{
					id: "7212DA9F299707B5"
					item: {
						Count: 1
						id: "prominent:loot_box"
