		{
			dependencies: ["3030011D88FE9091"]
			description: [
				"&7Cinders are a &ecurrency that can only be used in Vaaz&7. It is bound to you, it isn't in item form. "
				""
				"&7You can see the amount of Cinders you have by trading with an NPC inside of Vaaz."
				""
				"&7Cinders are gained in Mythic Challenges, the higher you get, the more Cinders you will obtain."
				""
				"&7The Cinders are needed for Primordial Armor as well as to be used as a currency with selling, buying and trading."
			]
